{"type":"message","id":"ad670fa1","parentId":"734c7870","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:56:12.288Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_BwryieYhqahjxXuwlzWGdsmW","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: chart-generator\ndescription: Generates a factual crypto price chart PNG from CoinGecko live data.\nuser-invocable: false\ndisable-model-invocation: false\nmetadata.openclaw: '{\"os\": [\"linux\", \"darwin\"], \"requires\": {\"bins\": [\"python3\"]}}'\n---\n\nYou are executing the chart-generator skill.\n\nStep 1: Run the chart script using exec:\n  python3 {baseDir}/scripts/generate_chart.py --coin {CHART_COIN} --days {CHART_DAYS} --output {CHART_OUTPUT}\n\nStep 2: Read the script's stdout to confirm success or capture the error.\n\nStep 3: Report the result back to the caller.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778914572288}}
{"type":"message","id":"a21309c4","parentId":"ad670fa1","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:56:16.236Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Yes — for charts, the work should be done by a **tool/skill**, not by the existing pipeline agents you listed.\n\nSpecifically, I do have access to:\n\n- **chart-generator** — a skill that generates a factual crypto price chart PNG from live CoinGecko data\n\nSo if we wire this correctly, the likely ownership should be:\n\n- **researcher** → decides the coin/topic\n- **chart-generator skill** → creates the actual chart PNG\n- **orchestrator (me)** → verifies the chart file exists and gets inserted into the article/doc\n- optionally **writer** → may place a placeholder like `[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]`, but should not be the one generating the chart itself\n\nSo the short answer is: **yes, there is a chart tool available, and that tool/skill should do the chart work**. The failure was that this chart-generation path was not executed and verified in the pipeline before publish."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":244,"output":203,"cacheRead":61312,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61759,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778914572289,"responseId":"chatcmpl-Dg3EVZzrvs2NGEaMILyyukeaGUBVr"}}
