{"type":"message","id":"6483d7dc","parentId":"8257884f","timestamp":"2026-05-16T07:20:07.693Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_QCuwewk3LQLoaiutZfkfnyhY","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"![Feature Image](/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg)\n\nMETA\n\n- SEO Title: CLARITY Act: Coinography Tracks Bitcoin Market Shift\n- Meta Description: Track how the CLARITY Act lifted Bitcoin sentiment, what Santiment's 1.55 ratio signals, and which market structure levels traders should watch next.\n- URL Slug: clarity-act-bitcoin-sentiment-market-structure\n- Categories: Bitcoin News, Latest News\n- Primary Keyword: CLARITY Act\n- Secondary Keywords: Bitcoin sentiment, market structure\n\n# CLARITY Act lifts Bitcoin to $79,084 as sentiment jumps\n\nCLARITY Act momentum pushed Bitcoin to $79,084 after the bill cleared its first major bipartisan checkpoint. BTC is now up 3.15% since May 1, which put U.S. regulation back at the center of crypto price action.\n\nSantiment said Bitcoin drew 1.55 bullish social media comments for every bearish one, while the Crypto Fear & Greed Index stayed at 31, or Fear. That mix tells traders optimism is improving faster than broader risk appetite.\n\nThis is a policy momentum trade, not a finished legislative win.\n\n## Bitcoin sentiment: What the CLARITY Act signals\n\n[78 more lines in file. Use offset=21 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778916007692}}
